# Root deploy of the BRAIN: the static site is web/dist, the one function is api/ask.mjs.
# The function's import closure (api/ask.mjs -> act, bin, core, memory, reason, tasks, world, seeds,
# cells, genome, mind, simulate, viz, lab, learning, cli, daemon, io, lang, capability, generations,
# self, tools/budget.mjs, bench/answer.mjs) must stay; everything else stays home.
# Every pattern is anchored to the root with a leading slash: an unanchored 'organism' also dropped
# web/dist/organism (the exact reader the page imports), which is how the live bar timed out on 2026-09-26.
